      "content": "it just doesn't make sense though. if you look at it objectively, there isn't any real weight to anything. life is just a series of random events that eventually end. if the end state is always zero, then the value of the journey is basically zero too. it feels like a math problem where the answer is always going to be nothing, so why keep calculating?",
